   "h": "Handle with care (adults first)",
   "items": [
    "Students may meet Ngäbe children at the camp school, or Ngäbe workers in the fields. **Never ask a family about wages, papers, migration or the comarca's poverty.** Those questions go to AMIGOS staff and the partner agencies.",
    "Host families may employ Ngäbe workers. The structure is not one family's choice.",
    "Do not use Eta, child labor or crowded houses to make the trip feel serious."
   ]
